  = note: `go2` passes it to `go`, which passes it to `Loader.load`, which passes it to `json.parse`
  = help: decodable field types are Int, Float, String, Bool, time.Date, time.Time, time.DateTime, json.Value, List(T), Option(T), Map(String, T), tuples, record and enum types (a generic one with its type arguments), types with a `json.Decode` impl, and aliases of these
